# Cloudflare Pages rewrites. Cloudflare only falls back to index.html for
# unknown URLs while there is no 404.html; with one, clean URLs need these.
# The functions/ routes (SEO tool pages, Public Desks, calendar proxy) take
# precedence; these rules are the static fallback if a function is skipped.

# Every tool URL is the app, which opens the tool from the path. Targets are
# extensionless: Cloudflare redirects /x.html to /x, which would drop the path.
/tools/*   /   200

# Public Desks: a page that loads the Desk in the browser.
/u/*       /u   200
